00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:05.360
technical roles. Like, you know, actually support&nbsp;
is technical, but I'm talking about like sales,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:13.000
marketing - I'm surprised how many people show&nbsp;
