"But you know, it'll be better than next time."&nbsp;

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:09.600
"Exactly. That's part of it. Be open to learning."
"Completely, completely. And so again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:14.600
